# Code owners for daily-recap.
#
# Every PR that touches a file matching a pattern below requires an approving
# review from one of the listed owners before it can merge (enforced by branch
# protection on `main`).
#
# Patterns follow the same syntax as .gitignore. The last matching pattern
# wins, so put more specific overrides at the bottom of the file.

# Default owner for everything in the repo.
* @nostos-lab

# Repo plumbing: CI, GitHub config, release scripts — same owner, kept explicit
# so future co-maintainers can be added per area without changing the default.
/.github/         @nostos-lab
/scripts/         @nostos-lab
/CONTRIBUTING.md  @nostos-lab
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md @nostos-lab
/SECURITY.md      @nostos-lab
/LICENSE          @nostos-lab
